PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "I am DRAKE of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "In their natural state, POKéMON are\n"
    .string "wild, free, and incredibly powerful.\p"
    .string "But when they are guided by a\n"
    .string "TRAINER who truly understands them,\l"
    .string "their potential is limitless!\p"
    .string "Do you possess the unyielding spirit\n"
    .string "required to master DRAGONS?\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Show me what you are made of!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I am DRAKE of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "You have returned to test your\n"
    .string "spirit against my DRAGONS once more.\p"
    .string "A true TRAINER never rests, and\n"
    .string "neither do my POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Our strength has grown beyond what\n"
    .string "you faced before.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "Show me how much you've grown!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Superb!\n"
    .string "Your spirit is truly unbreakable!$"

PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "You deserve every bit of your\n"
    .string "victory today.\p"
    .string "The bond you share with your\n"
    .string "POKéMON is an unstoppable force.\p"
    .string "Now, go forth!\n"
    .string "The final trial awaits you!$"

